cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you cite material from this archive, please use the metadata below. Per-session citations appear on each transcript page in the search site."
title: "Techspressionism Video Archive"
abstract: >-
  A searchable, citable transcript archive of Techspressionism's recorded
  video: the Techspressionist Salons (running since September 2020), artist
  interviews, roundtable discussions and artist presentations. Transcripts are
  machine-generated, may contain errors, and are timestamped on the YouTube
  video's timeline; citations use the YouTube address of the recording.
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Goldberg
    given-names: Colin
repository-code: "https://github.com/techspressionism/techspressionism-archive"
url: "https://techspressionism.com/"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - techspressionism
  - digital art
  - new media art
  - art and technology
  - artist talks
  - oral history
  - transcripts
